# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# exam-prep is Markdown-only.
#
# Strategy: ignore everything, then re-allow the few things that belong here.
# The `!*/` line is required so Git still walks into directories — without it
# no later negation could ever match a file inside a subdirectory.
#
# This file is a convenience, not the enforcement. The authoritative check is
# .github/workflows/markdown-only.yml, and .githooks/pre-commit catches
# mistakes before they are committed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

*

# Directories must stay walkable.
!*/

# Content: Markdown anywhere, images only under assets/.
!*.md
!assets/**/*.png
!assets/**/*.jpg
!assets/**/*.jpeg
!assets/**/*.gif
!assets/**/*.svg
!assets/**/*.webp

# The enforcement machinery itself.
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!.github/
!.github/**
!.githooks/
!.githooks/**
!.opencode/
!.opencode/**
